{
  No Fall Damage + No Air Break + Entity Immunity + BadBall AI Fix
  Credits to BookwormKevin for the original script!
  Players 1-4 respawn when falling into void (native Ball_Respawn).
  Badballs immune to killplanes (don't disappear).
  All balls always in NORMAL STATE — no flags that cause collision skip.
  Bumpers, mousetraps, badballs always collide with all balls.

  APPROACH: Prevent death_pending (0x2E9) and active flag (0x768) from
  being set/cleared. NOP all collision skip checks so collision always
  runs. Only hook entity list to clear 0x2E8 (prevent badball destroy).

  Patches:
  1. Ball_Shatter (0x8D70): RET 4
  2. Ball_SplitDeath (0x9050): RET
  3. Ball_FallDeath (0x9480): set 0x2E8=1 only (triggers respawn)
  4. bounce_count (0x75C9): NOP
  5. 0x2E9 sets (5 locations): NOP — death_pending never set
  6. 0x768 clears (4 locations): NOP — active flag never cleared
  7. Collision skips (10 locations): NOP — collision always runs
  8. Hook2 (+1B636): clear 0x2E8 on entity list only (prevent destroy)
}

[ENABLE]

alloc(FallDeath_Cave,64)
alloc(ClearState_Cave2,256)
alloc(Orig_8D70,3)
